WEBVTT

00:00:00.117 --> 00:00:05.445
This video shows how to keep staff qualifications and documents on your phone.

00:00:07.106 --> 00:00:17.354
Tap the menu button at the top left, open HR & Staff, and choose Documents. There are two tabs at the top: Qualifications and Documents.

00:00:20.492 --> 00:00:31.124
On the Qualifications tab, tap Add Qualification. A form opens. Tap Select staff and choose the staff member, here Ali Khan.

00:00:31.855 --> 00:00:43.471
Choose the type, here Degree. Then enter the qualification name, B.Ed Education, the institution, University of Punjab, and the year, 2018.

00:00:48.109 --> 00:00:54.685
Tap Create. A message says the qualification was added, and it appears in the list.

00:00:57.388 --> 00:01:09.580
Tap the Documents tab. It lists files such as contracts and ID cards. A yellow badge warns when a document is about to expire, like the one on this contract.

00:01:17.293 --> 00:01:29.821
To add a document, tap Add Document. Choose the staff member and the type, give it a title, and attach the file. The file is required, and there is an optional expiry date.

00:01:33.939 --> 00:01:38.235
For now, tap Cancel to close the form without saving.

00:01:44.494 --> 00:01:50.206
Staff records are kept in one place, with a warning before a document expires.
